From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fogtape <lilixu3210@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] src: expose required ECH for TLS and QUIC clients

Expose echConfigList and authenticated acceptance without plaintext-SNI
fallback. Use OpenSSL native peer verification for ECH, suppress QUIC
0-RTT, and build the vendored QUIC adapter with Android external OpenSSL.

Assisted-by: Codex
